  english:
    title: A Class
    message: A fires involve solid materials such as wood, paper, and fabric. These
      fires can form embers and may reignite. Water or dry chemical extinguishers
      should be used, and the base of the fire must be targeted.
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5d1d3c2bf092a341aed001f5b7b5194, type: 2}
  turkish:
    title: "A S\u0131n\u0131f\u0131"
    message: "A s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 yang\u0131nlar; ah\u015Fap, k\xE2\u011F\u0131t
      ve kuma\u015F gibi kat\u0131 maddelerin yanmas\u0131yla olu\u015Fur. Bu yang\u0131nlar
      kor olu\u015Fturarak tekrar alevlenebilir. M\xFCdahalede su veya kuru kimyevi
      tozlu t\xFCpler kullan\u0131lmal\u0131 ve yang\u0131n\u0131n taban\u0131na
      odaklan\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r."
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1f455b9fcfb118f4db6b0a71edd92cbe, type: 2}
